      "Python sources: a CppExtension/CUDAExtension/SyclExtension construction, written plain or qualified on the cpp_extension module, the Python module name it is given as its first argument, the module-level variable it is bound to, a torch.utils.cpp_extension load/load_inline JIT build with the name it is loaded under, and the use of torch's BuildExtension command class are materialized.",
